<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Iron Master - 110,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Wilhelmshaven 1-15/2 low $8.00s fio scale load/20,000 shex Preag.</p>
<p>ORE - Hydra - 150,000 tonnes western Australia/Beilun end Dec $4.60 fio scale load/30,000 shinc Eastern Rich.</p>
<p>TBN - 120,000 tonnes Seven Islands/Kaohsiung 12-22/1 approx. $10.50 fio 80,000 shinc/38,000 shinc China Steel.</p>
</text>
